        <paragraph>ⓐ If x is the number of minutes that Laura runs and y is the number minutes she bikes, find the inequality that models the situation.</paragraph>
        <paragraph>ⓑ Graph the inequality.</paragraph>
        <paragraph>ⓒ List three solutions to the inequality. What options do the solutions provide Laura?</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$15x+10y\ge 50015x+10y\ge 500$$ ⓑ</paragraph>
